{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Background:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During its voyage, the submarine suddenly experienced a mechanical failure. Dr. Pierre hurriedly began investigating, only to find abnormal intrusions in every area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate cases in the azure abyss, and follow Dr. Pierre to uncover the secrets of the Nautilus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-1.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the eerie atmosphere of the Nautilus, filled with secrets and unsettling anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort04.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-4.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience 2.5D deduction + puzzle gameplay, combine your observation skills to solve problems and navigate through various cabins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort03.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-2.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many anomalies are hidden in the submarine, related to the time vortex. Can you unlock the secrets of time and space and escape the submarine?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort01.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-3.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1866</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dr. Pierre, the owner of the Nautilus, and his seven sailors accidentally salvaged a &quot;compass&quot; during their voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This compass allowed him to glimpse his true position in the universe. It also caused the Nautilus to sink into a time vortex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort02.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2998</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Su&quot; is a student from a future city. During an underwater trip, she encountered an ancient submarine trapped in time and space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Su entered the submarine to explore but was captured by the time vortex into another unknown space-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players play as Dr. Pierre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interacting with items marked with time stamps can penetrate time to obtain more clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore interesting &quot;time wormholes&quot; and various props to uncover the truth of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2925090?t=1742492403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742492403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742492403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742492403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Background:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During its voyage, the submarine suddenly experienced a mechanical failure. Dr. Pierre hurriedly began investigating, only to find abnormal intrusions in every area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate cases in the azure abyss, and follow Dr. Pierre to uncover the secrets of the Nautilus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-1.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the eerie atmosphere of the Nautilus, filled with secrets and unsettling anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort04.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-4.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience 2.5D deduction + puzzle gameplay, combine your observation skills to solve problems and navigate through various cabins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort03.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-2.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many anomalies are hidden in the submarine, related to the time vortex. Can you unlock the secrets of time and space and escape the submarine?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort01.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/EN-3.png?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1866</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dr. Pierre, the owner of the Nautilus, and his seven sailors accidentally salvaged a &quot;compass&quot; during their voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This compass allowed him to glimpse his true position in the universe. It also caused the Nautilus to sink into a time vortex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/extras/Sort02.gif?t=1742492403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2998</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Su&quot; is a student from a future city. During an underwater trip, she encountered an ancient submarine trapped in time and space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Su entered the submarine to explore but was captured by the time vortex into another unknown space-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players play as Dr. Pierre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interacting with items marked with time stamps can penetrate time to obtain more clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore interesting &quot;time wormholes&quot; and various props to uncover the truth of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0</p>","developers":["QZQ Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925090/header.jpg?t=1742492403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies"